{"id": "EUVD-2026-92105", "enisaUuid": "0a42fe76-15a5-3be3-b0ca-a4f2b77c644b", "description": "ZITADEL 3.x before 3.4.14 and 4.x before 4.16.2 contains an authentication bypass in the hosted Login V1 and Login V2 UIs that accepts passkey or other authenticator enrollment on identify-only login sessions, before any primary factor is verified. Unauthenticated attackers knowing only a victim's login name can register an attacker-controlled authenticator and log in as that user, bypassing existing passwords and MFA.", "datePublished": "2026-10-04T13:10:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-05T14:55:02", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/zitadel/zitadel/security/advisories/GHSA-45f2-5q3r-xgg6", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/zitadel-before-3.4.14-and-4.16.2-account-takeover-via-passkey-enrollment"], "aliases": ["GHSA-4727-2r9w-rpch", "CVE-2026-105212"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.32, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "36592bdb-1d94-390c-bcf1-1ba05bf72ed5", "product": {"name": "zitadel", "vendor": {"name": "zitadel"}}, "product_version": "0 <4.16.2"}, {"id": "ff78e93c-44a8-3bb9-924d-d63c2c2a50c4", "product": {"name": "zitadel", "vendor": {"name": "zitadel"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.4.14"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9062b657-d384-309e-b243-65c29178d626", "vendor": {"name": "zitadel"}}], "isExploited": false}